# single energy/pressure evaluation of conf.data (108-atom Al-Li) with an ML-IAP unified model: -var pot <model>
units metal
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map yes
newton on
comm_style tiled
read_data conf.data
mass 1 26.9815
mass 2 6.94
thermo_style custom step pe press pxx pxy vol
pair_style mliap unified ${pot} 0
pair_coeff * * Al Li
run 0
